            "few of the studies conducted in North\nAmerica have been able to measure\ndissolved organic carbon and mercury\nlevels with the same level of precision as in\nGuédron, Tisserand, and colleagues' study.",
            "the mercury levels reported in Guédron,\nTisserand, and colleagues' study were\nmuch higher than those reported in the\nstudy by Hamelin and colleagues even\nthough the dissolved organic carbon levels\nreported in the two studies were\napproximately the same.",
