            "Guédron, Tisserand, and colleagues'\nfinding may differ from the findings of\nother studies due to a difference in\nenvironmental circumstances that affects\nthe relationship between dissolved organic\ncarbon and mercury in fresh water."
          ],
          "answer": 3,
