            "a lower percentage of nickel in its\ncomposition than stainless steel used to\nmanufacture induction cookers will."
          ],
          "answer": 2,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is C (Answer Key: Topic 3, Q38). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Reading real exam compilation."
        },
