            "believed that neither the nature sounds\nnor 'Sad but True' were at a volume of\n61.5 decibels.",
            "perceived the nature sounds and 'Sad but\nTrue' to be comparably meaningful despite\nperceiving the music to be quieter.",
            "adjusted the volume of the nature sounds\nto be greater than 61.5 decibels."
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is A (Answer Key: Topic 3, Q70). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Reading real exam compilation."
        },
        {
          "id": "satoplam-t03-q071",
          "skill": "Inference",
