            "although the area of the Murray Formation\nexperienced a prolonged period of dryness\nthat prevented a lake from forming, water\nflowing from a distant source was present."
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is A (Answer Key: Topic 3, Q80). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Reading real exam compilation."
        },
