          "source": "SAToplam 2.0 · Topic 3 · Q126",
          "passageTitle": "Inference — Q126",
          "passage": "Ocean Vuong's 2019 novel On Earth We're\nBriefly Gorgeous is regularly described as\nautobiographical. That characterization is\napt–there are many parallels between the\nexperiences of the novel's character of Little Dog\nand those of Vuong–but it should not be taken\nto mean that all the people and events depicted\nin On Earth We're Briefty Gorgeous are based\non actual people and events. The novel is largely\npure invention, and readers who neglect this fact\nand instead try to identify more and more\nreal-life analogues thus risk",
