          "skill": "Inference",
          "domain": "Information and Ideas",
          "focus": "Draw logical deductions, extensions, or implications based on text",
          "source": "SAToplam 2.0 · Topic 3 · Q148",
          "passageTitle": "Inference — Q148",
          "passage": "A group of primate conservationists recently\nbegan a long-term study of the effects of\ndifferent conservation strategies on the northern\nmuriqui (Brachyteles hypoxanthus). The species\npopulation is currently estimated to be around\n1,000. It is challenging to accurately count these\nprimates, however, which makes it difficult to\ntell whether the population is increasing,\ndecreasing, or staying stable. The study may\nthus",
